# Tests

Follow `docs/development/testing.md`.

- Use Swift Testing (`import Testing`, `@Test`, `#expect`) for package tests; XCTest only for UI and `measure` performance tests.
- Deterministic: drive time with explicit `dt`/`ManualClock`; randomness with `SeededRandomSource`. No `sleep`, no wall clock.
- Prefer parameterized tests for tables (frame counts 8/12/16/24/32, screen layouts, transitions).
- Test behavior and contracts, not implementation details; no coverage-only tests.
- Never delete, skip or weaken a test to make the build pass; fix the cause or report it.
- Fixtures live next to the test target (`Fixtures/`); never point tests at files outside the repo.
